      <li>On the <strong>Cluster Settings</strong> page, click the <strong>Configuration</strong> tab.</li>
      <li>On the <strong>Configuration</strong> page, click the <strong>Console</strong> configuration resource with the description <strong>operator.openshift.io</strong>. <img src="/openshift-docs-markdown/_assets/images/cluster-settings-console.png" alt="Image of the Configuration page showing the correct Console configuration resource to select" loading="lazy" /></li>
      <li>From the <strong>Action</strong> drop-down list, select <strong>Customize</strong>, which opens the <strong>Cluster configuration</strong> page.</li>
      <li>
      On the <strong>General</strong> tab, in the <strong>Quick starts</strong> section, you can select items in either the <strong>Enabled</strong> or <strong>Disabled</strong> list, and move them from one list to the other by using the arrow buttons.
      <ul>
